"You are about to delete Stock Lots for the selected companies.\n"
"\n"
"Stock operations should be deleted before deleting lots.\n"
"\n"
"This operation is irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Estás a punto de eliminar los lotes de las empresas seleccionadas.\n"
"\n"
"Las operaciones de existencias deben eliminarse antes de eliminar los lotes.\n"
"\n"
"Esta operación es irreversible."
#. module: cleaning_database_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/cleaning_database_operations/wizards/cleaning_database_warning_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"You are about to delete accounting operations for the selected companies.\n"
"\n"
"This operation is irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Estás a punto de eliminar las operaciones contables de las empresas seleccionadas.\n"
"\n"
"Esta operación es irreversible."
#. module: cleaning_database_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/cleaning_database_operations/wizards/cleaning_database_warning_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"You are about to delete all configured operational data for the selected companies.\n"
"\n"
"The cleanup will be performed in dependency order using batched DELETE operations.\n"
"\n"
"Stock Lots are NOT included in this cleanup and must be deleted separately if required.\n"
"\n"
"This operation is irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Estás a punto de eliminar todos los datos operativos para las empresas seleccionadas.\n"
"\n"
"La limpieza se llevará a cabo por orden de dependencia mediante operaciones DELETE por lotes.\n"
"\n"
"Los lotes NO se incluyen en esta limpieza y deben eliminarse por separado si es necesario.\n"
"\n"
"Esta operación es irreversible."
#. module: cleaning_database_operations
#. odoo-python
#: code:addons/cleaning_database_operations/wizards/cleaning_database_warning_wizard.py:0
msgid ""
"You are about to delete stock operations for the selected companies.\n"
"\n"
"The following objects will be deleted in dependency order: Stock Move Lines, Stock Valuation Layers, Stock Quants, Stock Moves and Stock Pickings.\n"
"\n"
"This operation is irreversible."
msgstr ""
"Estás a punto de eliminar operaciones de Stock de las empresas seleccionadas.\n"
"\n"
"Se eliminarán los siguientes objetos por orden de dependencia:  Stock Move Lines, Stock Valuation Layers, Stock Quants, Stock Moves and Stock Pickings.\n"
"\n"
"Esta operación es irreversible."
